---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="About FractureDetect" description="Learn about FractureDetect's mission, technology, and team" active="about" variant="marketing">
  <main class="page-enter">
    <section class="hero about-hero">
      <div class="hero-container">
        <div class="hero-content reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
          <div class="hero-badge">
            <span class="badge-dot"></span>
            About FractureDetect
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title">Empowering healthcare with <span class="text-gradient">AI-powered fracture detection</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">
            We build tools that help clinicians make faster, more accurate decisions. Our deep learning models are trained on thousands of annotated X-ray images to detect fractures with clinical-grade precision.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual reveal-right" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
          <div class="hero-xray-frame">
            <img src="/images/about-hero.webp" alt="AI fracture detection X-ray" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" loading="eager" />
            <div class="hero-xray-heatmap"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mission reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">Our Mission</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Why We Built FractureDetect</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Fracture detection shouldn't be a bottleneck in patient care.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-grid">
        <div class="mission-card">
          <div class="mission-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Speed</h3>
          <p>Reduce diagnosis time from hours to seconds. In emergency settings, every minute counts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-card">
          <div class="mission-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Accuracy</h3>
          <p>Deep learning models trained on diverse datasets achieve radiologist-level performance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-card">
          <div class="mission-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Accessibility</h3>
          <p>Bring expert-level fracture detection to clinics without 24/7 radiology coverage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tech reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">Technology</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Built on modern deep learning with clinical validation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tech-grid">
        <div class="tech-item">
          <div class="tech-num">01</div>
          <h3>Dual-Task Attention U-Net</h3>
          <p>Custom ResNet34-encoder architecture performing simultaneous fracture classification and pixel-level segmentation from a single forward pass.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
          <div class="tech-num">02</div>
          <h3>Stop-Gradient Training</h3>
          <p>The classification head reads the shared encoder without sending gradient back into it, so segmentation loss alone shapes the model's visual understanding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
          <div class="tech-num">03</div>
          <h3>Intrinsic Localization</h3>
          <p>Fracture regions are outlined directly from the model's own segmentation output — not a post-hoc approximation like Grad-CAM, but the model's actual reasoning made visible.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
          <div class="tech-num">04</div>
          <h3>Calibrated Confidence</h3>
          <p>Isotonic regression calibration ensures predicted confidence reflects real-world accuracy,  paired with independent uncertainty signals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
      <div class="stats-container">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-number" data-count-to="98.5" data-count-suffix="%">0%</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Detection Accuracy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-number" data-count-prefix="<" data-count-to="5" data-count-suffix="s"><0s</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Processing Time</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-number" data-count-to="50" data-count-suffix="K+">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Images in Training</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-number" data-count-to="12" data-count-suffix="+">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Anatomical Sites</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="team reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">Team</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Built by Clinicians and Engineers</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Our team combines radiology expertise with ML research.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar">AD</div>
          <h3>Dr. Ayisha Dauda</h3>
          <p class="team-role">Chief Medical Officer</p>
          <p class="team-bio">Board-certified radiologist, 15+ years trauma imaging experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar">YA</div>
          <h3>Dr. Yvette Addae</h3>
          <p class="team-role">CTO & Co-Founder</p>
          <p class="team-bio">ML engineer, ex-Google Health, published in CVPR & MICCAI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar">AR</div>
          <h3>Dr. Abass Rasheed</h3>
          <p class="team-role">VP Clinical Affairs</p>
          <p class="team-bio">Emergency physician, health tech advisor, FDA clearance experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-avatar">DK</div>
          <h3>Dauda Kasim</h3>
          <p class="team-role">Head of Engineering</p>
          <p class="team-bio">Full-stack architect, built HIPAA-compliant systems at scale.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
      <div class="cta-container">
        <div class="cta-content">
          <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to see it in action?</h2>
          <p class="cta-desc">Start analyzing X-rays with AI-powered fracture detection. No credit card required.</p>
          <div class="cta-buttons">
            <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started Free</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Contact Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero { min-height: calc(100vh - 68px); display: flex; align-items: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 48px 24px; }
  .hero-container { max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .hero-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-primary); background: rgba(37,99,235,0.08); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero-title { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.15; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 20px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .text-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), #a855f7); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
  .hero-description { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 400; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0; max-width: 540px; }
  .hero-visual { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-width: 0; }
  .hero-xray-frame {
    position: relative;
    background: #0b1121;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2), 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border);
    max-width: 400px;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
  }
  .hero-xray-frame img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
  .hero-xray-heatmap {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 42%, rgba(255,50,0,0.45) 0%, rgba(255,130,0,0.28) 20%, rgba(255,220,0,0.15) 38%, transparent 58%);
  }

  .section-header { text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 40px; padding: 0 24px; }
  .section-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-primary); background: rgba(37,99,235,0.08); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .section-title { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .section-desc { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }

  .mission { padding: 0 24px 80px; }
  .mission-grid { max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .mission-card { background: var(--color-surface-translucent); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px 28px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.25s ease; }
  .mission-card:hover { border-color: rgba(37,99,235,0.3); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(37,99,235,0.15), 0 0 60px rgba(37,99,235,0.06); transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .mission-icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(37,99,235,0.08); color: var(--color-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 16px; }
  .mission-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .mission-card p { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0; }

  .tech { padding: 0 24px 80px; background: var(--color-bg-subtle); }
  .tech-grid { max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .tech-item { background: var(--color-surface-translucent); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px 24px; transition: all 0.25s ease; }
  .tech-item:hover { border-color: rgba(37,99,235,0.3); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(37,99,235,0.15); transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .tech-num { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .tech-item h3 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .tech-item p { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0; }

  .stats { padding: 0 24px 80px; }
  .stats-container { max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 48px 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; }
  .stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .stat-number { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: 32px; color: white; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .stat-label { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
  .stat-divider { width: 1px; height: 48px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }

  .team { padding: 0 24px 80px; }
  .team-grid { max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .team-card { background: var(--color-surface-translucent); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.25s ease; }
  .team-card:hover { border-color: rgba(37,99,235,0.3); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(37,99,235,0.12); transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .team-avatar { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), #1d4ed8); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; color: white; margin: 0 auto 16px; }
  .team-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .team-role { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .team-bio { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0; }

  .cta { padding: 0 24px 80px; }
  .cta-container { max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 64px 40px; text-align: center; }
  .cta-title { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; color: white; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .cta-desc { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cta-buttons .btn-primary { box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(37,99,235,0.4); }
  .cta-buttons .btn-secondary { color: white; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); background: transparent; }
  .cta-buttons .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: white; color: white; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-container { gap: 40px; }
    .hero-title { font-size: 38px; }
    .mission-grid, .tech-grid, .team-grid { gap: 18px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-title { font-size: 34px; }
    .hero-description { font-size: 17px; }
    .tech-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero { min-height: auto; }
    .hero-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; padding: 40px 24px 0; }
    .hero-visual { order: 1; }
    .hero-content { order: 2; }
    .hero-xray-frame { max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero-title { font-size: 30px; }
    .hero-description { font-size: 16px; }
    .mission-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tech-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .section-title { font-size: 26px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; padding: 24px 20px 0; }
    .hero-xray-frame { max-width: 280px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero-title { font-size: 24px; }
    .hero-description { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .hero-badge { font-size: 12px; padding: 5px 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .cta-buttons { flex-direction: column; }
    .btn { justify-content: center; width: 100%; font-size: 15px; padding: 13px 24px; }
    .team-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stats-container { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding: 36px 24px; }
    .stat-divider { width: 48px; height: 1px; }
  }
</style>